SCOPE OF THIS RELEASE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This tool measures one thing: whether a declared version label identifies exactly
one state of the producing code at the points where a repository publishes.

It checks that a record is WELL-FORMED. It does not re-execute recorded code
states, does not attest that a published artefact can be re-produced, does not
certify provenance, and issues no attestation of any kind. SCOPE.md states this
boundary in full, including what this tool will not be extended to do.

